text @[{$lnmA}]
text Tomoya-kun...
text As she lies in bed, {$lnmC} turns her face to look at me.
sound JXO.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text ...I was the one who couldn't keep going.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? What're you talking about?
sound JXP.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Talking while we go to school.
text @[Tomoya]
text There's nothing we can do about that. It's not like it's your fault.
sound JXQ.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text That's not true... It's my fault for having such a weak body...
text @[Tomoya]
text I just told you, that isn't true.
sound JXR.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text ...
sound JXS.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Okay... I'm sorry.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
