text {$lnmC} is acting more timid than usual. Maybe it's because of her illness..
text Ever since that day we met at the bottom of the hill...
text She's been trying so hard.
text ...Even though she couldn't reform the drama club in the end.
text Or could it be that at some point...
text ...the two of us ran from the rest of the world into the comforting weakness of thinking that the only thing that mattered was being together?
text I don't want that to be the case.
text I'm sure we looked reality in the eye when we worked as hard as we did.
text And that's not going to change from here on, either.
text ......
text I didn't see it happen, but {$lnmC}'s eyes are now closed, and she's sleeping.
text @[Tomoya]
text (She's so defenseless...)
text I put my hand to cheek and feel her warmth.
text I'm sure there are many more troubled times ahead of us.
text For both her and me.
text That's how I feel things will go.
text That's why we should consider this a short little break, that's all.
text I let go of her hand and stand up.
text I leave the room so as not to wake her.
